## Question 3: Choose the number of dimensions

Fit classical MDS representations using one to five dimensions and calculate the relative distance error for each representation. Comment on the results.

$$
\text{relative distance error}
=
\left[
\frac{
\sum_{i<j}(d_{ij}-\delta_{ij})^2
}{
\sum_{i<j}\delta_{ij}^2
}
\right]^{1/2}.
$$

```{r}
